Package: iearthdata
Title: Client for the iEarth DataHub API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Hugh", , , "hugh@belian.earth", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R client for the iEarth DataHub at data-starcloud.pcl.ac.cn.
    Performs bounding-box and time-period queries against hosted Earth-
    observation datasets and returns pre-signed download URLs for the
    intersecting assets. Primary use case is access to the SDC30 Embedded
    Seamless Data (ESD) global land monitoring dataset.
